  {
    "name": "visp_reproduce",
    "title": "Attach a failing reproduction",
    "description": "Link an existing current failed behavioral execution to an unresolved functional finding before editing. Supply the execution ID and explain its relationship to the report. Does not execute a check or resolve the finding. After repair, rerun the same check and relevant adjacent behavior, then obtain separate assessment.",
